# Skill roots outside this repo, linked into ~/.copilot/skills/.
#
# One path per line. `#` comments and blank lines are ignored. `~` expands.
# Each path is a directory containing `<name>/SKILL.md`, the same layout as
# copilot/skills/ here.
#
# Use this for skills too personal to publish in a public dotfiles repo. Only
# the path lives here; the skills stay in whatever repo owns them.
#
# `script/sync-copilot install` links each one. A root that isn't checked out
# on this machine warns and is skipped. `disabled: true` is honored the same
# way as for repo-local skills, and an existing real file is never replaced.

~/github/notes/copilot/skills
